Package: libovt-core1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Open Video Tools core library (runtime)
 Bitstream, container and metric analysis library behind the ovt command-line
 tool and OVT Studio. Decoders live in the ovt-plugin-* packages.

Package: libovt-render1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libs
Depends: libovt-core1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers
Description: Open Video Tools rendering library (runtime)
 libplacebo-based Vulkan renderer with HDR and tone-mapping support.

Package: libovt-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libdevel
Depends: libovt-core1 (= ${binary:Version}), libovt-render1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Open Video Tools C API (development files)
 Headers, ovt-config.cmake and the ovt-core pkg-config file.

Package: ovt-cli
Architecture: any
Depends: libovt-core1 (= ${binary:Version}), ovt-plugin-aom (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: ovt-plugin-ffmpeg (= ${binary:Version}), ovt-plugin-de265 (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Open Video Tools command-line analyzer
 The ovt command: probe, syntax dumps, metrics and reports for H.264, H.265 and
 AV1 streams.

Package: ovt-studio
Architecture: any
Depends: ovt-cli (= ${binary:Version}), libovt-render1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Open Video Tools graphical analyzer
 OVT Studio: Qt Quick GUI for bitstream, motion vector and container
 inspection.

Package: ovt-plugin-aom
Architecture: any
Depends: libovt-core1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Open Video Tools AV1 analysis plugin (libaom)
 AV1 decoding with inspection hooks. Contains a static copy of libaom built with
 CONFIG_INSPECTION, because Debian's libaom is built without it (see
 debian/README.source). Covered by the AOMedia patent licence (PATENTS).

Package: ovt-plugin-ffmpeg
Architecture: any
Depends: libovt-core1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Open Video Tools FFmpeg decoder plugin
 AVC/H.264 and other decoders through the system FFmpeg. Several of the codecs
 it enables are patent-encumbered in some jurisdictions.

Package: ovt-plugin-de265
Architecture: any
Depends: libovt-core1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Open Video Tools HEVC analysis plugin (libde265)
 HEVC/H.265 decoding with inspection hooks. HEVC is patent-encumbered in some
 jurisdictions.

Package: python3-ovt
Architecture: any
Section: python
Depends: libovt-core1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${python3:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Open Video Tools Python bindings
 Python 3 module (ovt_py) exposing the OVT analysis API.
